  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response for the Containment of Cholera</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Respuesta de Emergencia para la Contencin de la Epidemia de Clera</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir a reducir la morbilidad y la mortalidad debidas al clera y la contencin de los brotes de enfermedades relacionadas con la persistencia de la vida precaria y las condiciones sanitarias.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to reduce morbidity and mortality due to cholera and the containment of other disease outbreaks related to the persisting precarious living and sanitation conditions. Through budget support to the MSPP and financing to Non-governmental organizations for additional capacity to provide services.</narrative>
  </description>
